  "name": "A Comprehensive Image and Video Dataset for Computer Vision-Based Safety Monitoring in Foundation Pit Construction",
  "description": "This V2 release extends the original image dataset by adding meticulously curated video sequences, transforming it into a multi-modal benchmark for construction safety monitoring. It facilitates research not just on static scene understanding but also on dynamic activity analysis and temporal risk modeling in foundation pit engineering, addressing the scarcity of specialized datasets that capture the evolving nature of construction sites.",
